# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the machine default here) rewrites every
# text file to CRLF on checkout, so the same file shows as modified after a
# round-trip and diffs churn on line endings alone.
#
# This matters for `cluster.patch.yml`: install.mjs compares the installed block
# against marker lines, and `scripts/validate.mjs` parses the YAML. Both tolerate
# either ending, but keeping the tree at LF means what is committed is exactly
# what the scripts read.
* text=auto eol=lf
